Equation of LOI is $\frac{\mathrm{x}}{1}=\frac{\mathrm{y}}{1}=\frac{\mathrm{z}}{1}$
DR: of PT $\rightarrow \alpha-1, \alpha+2, \alpha-3$
DR: of QR → 1, 1, 1
$$\begin{array}{l}
\Rightarrow(\alpha-1) \times 1+(\alpha+2) \times 1+(\alpha-3) \times 1=0 \\
3 \alpha=2 \\
\alpha=\frac{2}{3}
\end{array}$$
$$\begin{aligned}
\sin 2 \theta=\sqrt{1-\left(\frac{11}{27}\right)^{2}} & =\frac{\sqrt{38} \sqrt{16}}{27} \\
& =\frac{4}{27} \sqrt{38}
\end{aligned}$$
$$\begin{array}{l}
\text { Area }=\frac{1}{2} \times \sqrt{18} \sqrt{18} \times \frac{4}{27} \sqrt{38} \\
=\frac{18}{2} \times \frac{4}{27} \sqrt{38}=\frac{36}{27} \sqrt{38}=\frac{4}{3} \sqrt{38}
\end{array}$$
